[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0010","text":"——哦……\n好多啊。这些服装"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0020","text":"嗯？……啊\n哈哈，这里的只是一小部分啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0030","text":"……不错嘛，这个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0040","text":"哦，不错\n这个也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0050","text":"哦……\n你对服装感兴趣吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0060","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0070","text":"不，那个……\n我是觉得，你有自己明确的判断标准"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0080","text":"诶，啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0090","text":"因为看起来暖和，肚子\n这个还有这个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0100","text":"别着凉了\n妈妈说的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22000100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
